  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Panoramic Data's EPPlus Free Edition\n\t\t\t# LGPL License continue\n\t\t\tLarge workbooks can now be saved. A workbook that exceeded the classic ZIP limits, being 4 GB of size or offset or 65,534 internal entries, previously threw while saving, after all of its content had been built. Zip64 is now used automatically when, and only when, a workbook needs it, so files that fit the classic format are written exactly as before and remain readable by older tools.\n\n\t\t\tThis release targets .NET 10. The previous release, 10.1.1, targeted .NET 9.",
